; The Melange backend: implements Reativa's [Dom] and [History] virtual modules
; with Melange's [external ... [@@mel.*]] FFI.
;
; Reativa's default backend — [(libraries reativa)] resolves here without
; naming it (see [default_implementation] in src/dune).
;
; The public name is deliberately NOT [reativa.melange]: melange-mode artifacts
; install under lib/<pkg>/melange/, so a sublibrary by that name collides with
; them ("Multiple rules generated for lib/reativa/melange/reativa__View.cmi").
;
; reativa_runtime.js ships alongside the emitted modules; the handful of
; externals bound to it (rather than to "#..." melange primitive spellings)
; are what keep this module compilable by the native toolchain too.
(library
 (name reativa_melange)
 (public_name reativa.melange_backend)
 (implements reativa)
 (modes melange native byte)
 (melange.runtime_deps reativa_runtime.js)
 (preprocess
  (pps melange.ppx)))
